# Everything in scripts/ is copied onto k3-master and run by bash or read by
# systemd. With CRLF line endings bash fails with "bad interpreter: ^M" and
# systemd silently mis-parses the unit — during setup, or worse, during a
# restore. Force LF on checkout regardless of the developer's platform.
*.sh              text eol=lf
*.yaml            text eol=lf
scripts/systemd/* text eol=lf

# Docs are read, not executed, but keeping them uniform avoids noisy diffs.
*.md              text eol=lf
